#. ~ Help message in menu "<h|H>: Morale and learning"
#: data/help/texts.json
msgid ""
"You can disable a skill in the Player Info Menu (press <press_player_data>) "
"if you don't want to practice it, and it will prevent focus drain while "
"performing relevant actions, but you will not progress in that skill while "
"it's disabled."
msgstr ""
"기술을 연습하고 싶지 않다면 플레이어 정보 메뉴에서 기술을 비활성화할 수 있으며(<press_player_data> 누르기), "
"비활성화하면 관련 동작을 수행하는 동안 집중력 소모는 방지되지만 비활성화된 동안에는 해당 기술을 증가시킬 수 없습니다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "28 days later"
msgstr "28일 후"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Trapper"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A good trap doesn't discriminate between beavers and zombeavers."
msgstr "좋은 함정은 차별을 두지 않지."

#. ~ Description of achievement "Tailor"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A needle, a thread, and a dream."
msgstr "바늘과 실로 꿈을 잇는다."

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A time to every purpose under heaven"
msgstr "어떤 일이든 때가 있다"

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "A veritable hunt unending"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Accomplished Survivor"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of achievement
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Ace Driver"
msgstr "일등 운전사"

#. ~ Name of achievement
