"A thin paper strip intended for the rolling of cigarettes or other "
"smokeables."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "air rifle hunting pellet"
#: data/json/items/ammo.json data/mods/Generic_Guns/ammo/rifle_pellet.json
