msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr "전신, 턱시도. 멸망한 세상도 조금은 고급스럽게 느껴지게 합니다."

#. ~ Description of "longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A full-length coat made of tough, rain-repellant material.  It has several "
"pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-length coat made of warm animal fur."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A full-length leather coat with many pockets for storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "turnout coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters, highly resistant to heat and "
"flame."
msgstr "소방관이 착용하는 무거운 보호용 코트. 열과 화염에 아주 강합니다."

#. ~ Description of "peacoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A heavy wool coat, warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "army winter jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  Favored by"
" the military."
msgstr "많은 주머니와 후드가 달린 튼튼한 자켓. 보온을 위해 안감이 두텁고, 군대에서 많이 쓰입니다."

#. ~ Description of "jean jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from denim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flannel jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket made from flannel, favored by outdoorsy types."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faux fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A jacket made of fake animal fur.  While not as fancy as a fur coat, its "
"garish appearance still makes quite a statement."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tactical jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A jacket with a hood and several pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A letterman jacket, the type that the jocks in a highschool or a college "
"would wear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "windbreaker"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr "후드 달린 가벼운 합성섬유 재킷. 많이 따뜻하진 않지만, 비를 막아줍니다."

#. ~ Description of "nylon bomber jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A lightweight nylon bomber jacket."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "greatcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long overcoat made from durable heavyweight wool."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "lab coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr "여러 개의 큰 주머니가 달린 길고 하얀 코트. 멋진 포켓 프로텍터가 달려있습니다."

#. ~ Description of "thawb"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves.  A traditional Arab garment."
msgstr "길고, 루즈한 핏의 폭넓은 소매가 달린 로브로, 아랍 전통 의상입니다."

#. ~ Description of "robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long, plush housecoat, perfect for lounging around the house."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A long-sleeved top that drapes almost to the knees."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "haori"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is typically worn unfastened over a "
"kimono."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tangzhuang"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting Chinese jacket with a mandarin collar and frog ties down the"
" front.  These were once common street fashion in China, but have long since"
" become associated with martial arts from that country."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rag tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift knee-length robe with a string tied around the waist to keep it "
"all in place."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wizard robe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A mysterious and arcane-looking robe.  It has a hood and some pockets for "
"your magical artifacts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cassock"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr "주로 가톨릭 사제가 입는 사제복."

#. ~ Description of "Santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A red jacket, trimmed with white faux fur, commonly used by bearded men on "
"Christmas.  Warm and has a couple of small pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length longcoat that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has "
"plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sexy Santa jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A short red jacket with white faux fur as trim.  It's sleeveless, so Santa "
"can show off his guns when he comes down your chimney this year."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless tunic"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "상체와 다리를 덮는 민소매 천옷."

#. ~ Description of "leather jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A soft leather jacket.  It's tough, but not as heavy-duty as the kind "
"favored by motorcyclists."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bathrobe"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A terrycloth housecoat generally worn on the way to or from the bath."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather riding jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick and heavy leather jacket used most commonly by motorcyclists, "
"equestrians, and other Road Warriors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "faux fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur longcoat, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick fur full-length longcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless leather longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick leather full-length longcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sleeveless faux fur longcoat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thick, sleeveless faux fur longcoat, falling below your knees.  Has many "
"pockets for storing things."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "light jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A thin jacket with a hood.  It's good for brisk weather, not so much for "
"rain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kasaya"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional ankle-length Buddhist robe, stitched together from three "
"pieces of traditional saffron dyed cloth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kimono"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "samghati"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, double-layered Buddhist coat.  Used as an outer cloak for "
"various occasions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "jean vest"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A vest made from denim."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "army jacket"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A vintage piece of a military uniform from the 20th century, or possibly a "
"newer reproduction of one.  It's a comfortable jacket made of lightweight "
"poplin"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rain coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid ""
"A vinyl coat with a hood and two very large pockets, meant to provide "
"protection from rain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "fur coat"
#: data/json/items/armor/coats.json
msgid "A warm jacket made of animal fur, once a symbol of wealth."
