msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid "A pair of sunglasses, good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr "선글라스. 눈부심을 방지해줍니다."

#. ~ Description of "transition bifocal glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of transition bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and"
" far-sighted.  Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken "
"when exposed to ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light "
"diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "transition corrective glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A pair of transition glasses for the near-sighted.  Contains photochromic "
"dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to ultraviolet rays from "
"sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses fade back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather eyepatch"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A patch of black leather to cover an eye, with a string to keep it from "
"falling off.  If wearing this doesn't make you feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "stylish transition reading glasses"
#: data/json/items/armor/eyewear.json
msgid ""
"A stylish pair of glasses for the far-sighted.  Useless for anyone else.  "
"Contains photochromic dyes that cause the lenses to darken when exposed to "
"ultraviolet rays from sunlight.  When the UV light diminishes, the lenses "
