msgid ""
"Made from only the cheapest of budget metals, firing one of the weakest "
"cartridges, and having a hearty laugh at the concept of user safety, this "
".22 caliber pocket pistol is of questionable utility at best.  Affordably "
"priced before the Cataclysm, the pistol's price point was arguably its only "
"positive element, an element which pertains zero bearing on your current "
"situation."
