#. ~ Description of gun "Desert Tech MDRX carbine"
#. ~ Description of "Desert Tech MDRX carbine"
#: data/json/items/gun/223.json
msgid ""
"Produced by the Desert Tech gun company, this is a highly modular, semi-"
"automatic rifle of remarkably modest dimensions.  The weapon is notable for "
"the simplicity of converting it to fire a wide number of different "
"cartridges, with retool kits for .223 Remington, .308 Winchester, and .300 "
"AAC Blackout being available."
msgstr ""

