#. ~ Description of "M224 mortar"
#: data/json/items/gun/60mm.json
msgid ""
"The Lightweight Company Mortar System is a portable mortar that can be "
"carried and used by a single person, provided they have access to 60mm "
"mortar shells.  There are a set of firing tables attached to it, but it will"
" likely take some expertise with launchers to understand them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "M202A1 FLASH rocket launcher"
#. ~ Description of "M202A1 FLASH rocket launcher"
#: data/json/items/gun/66mm.json
msgid ""
"An American rocket launcher designed in the 1970s to replace WWII-era "
"flamethrowers still in use in Vietnam.  It has four barrels sharing the 66mm"
" caliber of the M72 LAW."
msgstr ""

