"Certificate of Analysis, each line listing a test method, result, and "
"reviewer's signature, all in service of… something.  On one distinctive page"
" a series of checkmarks slowly appear and fade around <color_yellow>\"500 "
"units of mutagen per 500 units of primer\"</color> ratio."
