#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid "Loosen Limbs"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of gun "fiberglass recurve bow"
#. ~ Description of "fiberglass recurve bow"
#: data/json/items/ranged/archery.json
msgid ""
"The fiberglass limbs of this modern-day short bow curve back on themselves, "
"giving it a decent amount of power despite its size.  It can be activated to"
" fold down for easy storage when not in use."
msgstr ""

