#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of thin, round sunglasses.  The tinted glass seems to reflect the "
"same shade of baleful orange light no matter what light it reflects."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Hawaiian shirt"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A slightly worn button-down shirt with a tropical pattern, straight out of "
"the 80's.  You swear that every time you look away and look back, the "
"pattern changes subtly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "engraved cube"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A small cube of smooth rock.  A uniform grid of nine squares is engraved in "
"each of its faces."
msgstr ""

