"A handful of fine gray tin powder, usable for making solder and lining "
"containers to prevent corrosion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "magnesium powder"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A handful of powdered magnesium, a highly flammable alkaline earth metal.  "
"Useful for constructing flares and similar items."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "half-meter length of railroad track"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A heavy half-meter length of railroad track with a smooth top, liberated "
"from a now-defunct rail line.  Could be used as a makeshift anvil, "
"especially with some modifications, or as spare steel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "length of railroad track"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A heavy one-meter length of railroad track with a smooth top, liberated from"
" a now-defunct rail line.  Far too heavy to be useful for much as-is, but "
"perhaps could be shaped into something with some metalworking skill, or cut "
"down into an anvil if sawed in half first."
msgstr ""

