#. ~ Description of "SADM mininuke"
#: data/json/items/tool/explosives.json
msgid ""
"The B54 Special Atomic Demolition Munition is an extremely powerful weapon, "
"a portable nuclear bomb, using the smallest nuclear warhead in US inventory."
"  It is housed inside a extremely sturdy transit container.  Use it to "
"activate the timer.  You guess that the explosion would be large enough to "
"take out a small house."
