msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "first aid spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/med.json
msgid ""
"Polymer dissolved in a disinfectant solution for minor cuts and scrapes, "
"packaged in a tiny bottle with an atomizer spray for convenient application."
"  When applied, it quickly bonds to the skin and dries to stop bleeding and "
"form a protective barrier against microbes."
msgstr ""

