#. ~ Description of monster "zombie wolf"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Putrescence oozes from its mouth to coat vicious-looking "
"yellow fangs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "rotting zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this limping canine corpse.  Its whole body is "
"covered in chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie cow"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Dairy cows have no natural weapons, but a zombie as big, heavy, and "
"murderous as this is still extremely dangerous."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie horse"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"From the deteriorated state of this undead horse's ghastly features--"
"protruding ribs, off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it doesn't "
"seem like it should put up much of a fight, but something deep inside gives "
"it power.  Reeking pus drips from its wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "abyssal terror"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Once a former apex predator of the seas, now an undead nightmare, this "
"zombified Great White shark terrorizes the waters with its relentless hunger"
" and aggression."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zeindeer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Once a majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles Santa's "
"helpful reindeer and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie shark"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this undead terror "
"is now even more aggressive and more hungry, possibly thanks to its lack of "
"a functioning brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie pig"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The body of a stout, scruffy pig, reanimated now and somehow even angrier "
"than it was in life."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr "변형된 채로 움직이는 개의 시체로, 그들의 두 발 달린 친구들을 손쉽게 따라잡을 수 있을 정도로 빠릅니다."

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie goat"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The moving corpse of what once was a goat is now left stumbling around, its "
"vacant eyes looking for anything alive to kill."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie deer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The ragged remains of this woodland ungulate stagger madly about in search "
"of anything that breathes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "undead attack dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"The reanimated corpse of a dog used in law enforcement.  Its deformed body "
"is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "zombie llama"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid "The vicious vicuña spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombear"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes have gone filmy-white, and its flesh is torn and "
"scarred.  It moves with an unnaturally graceless gait."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombull"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This enormous, terrifyingly fast creature with blood-bloated eyes and "
"dreadful horns was once a domestic bull.  While live bulls can be "
"temperamental, unbridled rage is now this one's only emotion."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie moose"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection that is killing "
"the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie llama"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This llama oozes a dark oil from a multitude of lesions and cuts.  Its wool "
"has sloughed off with parts of its skin, revealing pulsating muscles and "
"flesh.  Its mouth drips with a sickly green substance which it seems to be "
"chewing on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie sheep"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This sheep's once pure white wool is now barely hanging by its rotten flesh,"
" held together by dried mud and blood.  Its legs now buckle as the rotten "
"muscles have a hard time sustaining the rest of the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombie tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its eyes wide open and "
"shining yellow-white."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "zombeaver"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, its gore-stained ribs "
"clearly visible.  Foamy corpse-bile dribbles from around its fearsome orange"
" incisors, which look all the more intimidating now that the flesh of its "
"face has begun to peel away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "frail zombie deer"
#: data/json/monsters/zed-animal.json
msgid ""
"What might have once been a noble creature has been reduced to a sorry sack "
"of skin and bones, oozing gore as it trots along clumsily in search of "
"something to kill."
msgstr ""

