msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] "잽터"

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A deformed, sickly-looking animated corpse of a canine.  A dangerous-looking"
" yellow saliva drips from its mouth."
msgstr "뒤틀려져, 토가 나올 것 같이 생긴 개의 일으켜진 시체입니다. 입에서는 위험해 보이는 황색 침을 흘리고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of monster "wretched puker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Various pieces of trash and "
"waste materials have melded into the black goo leaking from its skin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "spitter zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping "
"cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is "
"swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr ""
"이마와 축 늘어진 뺨 안에 눈이 밀려들어가 있고, 주름 잡힌 입이 얼굴 대부분을 차지하고 있는 구부정한 인간 시체입니다. 복부는 "
"부어오르고 거의 반투명한데다가 안에서는 역겨운 노란색 물질이 꿀렁거리고 있습니다."

#. ~ Description of monster "acidic zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking zombie.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, "
"yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr "역겨운 시체입니다. 피부가 대단히 앏고, 고약하고 누런 액체가 동맥을 타고 흐르는게 또렷하게 보입니다."

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "acidic zombie"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "acidic zombie dog"
#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "festering acid hound"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s barfs acid!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "wretched puker"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s pukes acid!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "festering acid hound"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"The reeking remains of what was once a dog.  Its torso is swollen up like a "
"barrel, supported by unnaturally elongated legs.  Its fur has mostly been "
"burned off by a corrosive liquid that leaks from is jaws and puckered sores "
"all over its body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "corrosive zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid ""
"This zombie has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold "
"itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated, leathery "
"body.  It moves clumsily, but spits from a large reserve of acid with "
"uncanny accuracy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "산성 좀비"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "acidic zombie dog"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "산성 좀비 개"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/zed_acid.json
msgid "corrosive zombie"
