#. ~ Description of mutation "Arthropod Limbs"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
msgid ""
"An extra pair of decidedly buggy arms have grown from your torso.  They "
"flail more or less uncontrollably, making you feel rather larval."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Insect Arms"
#: data/json/mutations/mutations.json
