msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I don't really know what I believe.  It's too sad to think about.  I just "
"wanted to help people, and I wonder, how many of the crazies out there were "
"just like me before it got to them?  A lot of them - the zombies, too - they"
" must have been good people, once.  It's too bad.  Too bad…"
msgstr ""

