"FROM: Jamie Forest, Community Resident, Unit A02\n"
"  TO: Shady Hills Corporation, Service Portal\n"
"  RE: Seriously!?\n"
"\n"
" My son just told me he keeps receiving advertisements in the mail for a nursing home.  He told me that your company runs it!  Are you trying to get rid of me!?  You're sick!  I demand you have your CEO call me!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
