msgid ""
"&The mercenary seems uncharacteristically upbeat, or perhaps just drunk.  "
"\"Found this neat gizmo in a bank run a few days ago.\"  <mypronoun> blurts "
"while procuring a small cube of etched glass from <mypossesivepronoun> "
"pocket.  \"Now, I have no use for such a thing, but perhaps you do.  What do"
" you say?  It's yours for 3 coins.\""
