msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night"
" for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
