msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "I've heard that cougars sometimes leap.  Maybe it's just a myth."
msgstr "쿠거가 가끔 뛰어오른다는 소리를 들었어. 아마 거짓말이겠지."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
