#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your epic touchdown was ruined when your coach's guts were torn out by "
"undead fans.  Now you're first pick in the apocalypse draft."
msgstr ""
"당신의 멋진 터치다운은 언데드 팬들에 의해 코치의 내장이 찢어지면서 망가졌습니다. 이제 당신은 종말 드래프트에서 1순위로 지명되었습니다."

#. ~ Description of profession "Football Player" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your epic touchdown was ruined when your coach's guts were torn out by "
"undead fans.  Now you're first pick in the apocalypse draft."
msgstr ""
