#. ~ Description of scenario "Emergency Shutdown" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm happened, you were working in a nuclear power plant.  Now"
" you're trapped inside, surrounded by the shambling bodies of what used to "
"be your coworkers.  The reactor's shut down, but you don't know if there's "
"been a radiation leak and you need to get away from here fast before you "
"find out the hard way."
msgstr ""
"원자력발전소에서 일하고 있을 때 대격변이 일어났고, 한때 동료들이었던 시체들와 함께 원자력발전소에 갇혀 버렸습니다. 원자로는 정지했지만 "
"방사능이 누출되었는지 알 수 없으므로 지금은 조사보다 도망치는 편이 먼저입니다."

