#. ~ Description of scenario "Fungal Infection" for female
#. ~ Description of scenario "Challenge - Fungal Infection" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json data/mods/innawood/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You feel spores crawling beneath your skin.  It's only a matter of time."
msgstr "당신은 당신의 피부 밑에서 포자가 기어다니는 것을 느낍니다. 이제 시간문제입니다."

