msgid ""
"A shotshell 'speedloader', a long plastic tube with a prominent plastic "
"follower.  You can feed 6 shotshells into an appropriately modified shotgun "
"by pushing the follower against the shotgun's loading port.  Bulky, but sees"
" use in competition occasionally."
