msgid ""
"The dead body of a deep one.  Its forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of its head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "deep one corpse"
#: data/mods/Mythos-Creatures/items/corpses/mythos.json
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead deep one body, as if torn apart with enormous "
"force.  Some organs are hanging out."
msgstr ""

