"You have come into possession of a small, ethereal storage container that "
"cannot be removed or destroyed.  It can hold 750 mL and will bring items "
"back to the island with you, even when you die."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mutation "Security Alpha"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/secure_container.json
msgid ""
