"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the "
"reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading "
