msgid "There aren't any plants that are ready to harvest…"
msgstr "수확할만큼 익은 식물이 없습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1698
msgid "Which plants do you want to have harvested?"
msgstr "어떤 작물을 수확할까요?"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1702
msgid "You decided to hold off for now…"
msgstr "지금 당장은 내버려두기로 합니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1752
msgid ""
"You don't have enough to pay the workers to harvest the crop, so you are "
"forced to sell…"
msgstr "농작물을 추수한 노동자들에게 지불할 돈이 없어, 농작물을 팔아야 했습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1755
#, c-format
msgid "Do you wish to sell the crop of %1$d %2$s for a profit of %3$d merch?"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1761
#, c-format
msgid "The %s are sold for %d merch…"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1769 src/mission_companion.cpp:1778
#, c-format
msgid "You receive %d %s…"
msgstr "%d %s(을)를 받았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1808 src/mission_companion.cpp:1859
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1964
#, c-format
msgid ""
"While scavenging, %s's party suddenly found itself set upon by a large mob "
"of undead…"
msgstr "수색 도중, %s 일행이 대규모 시체 무리에 둘러싸였습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1812 src/mission_companion.cpp:1863
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1968
msgid "Through quick thinking the group was able to evade combat!"
msgstr "재빠른 판단 덕분에, 일행이 전투를 회피했습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1814 src/mission_companion.cpp:1865
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1970
msgid "Combat took place in close quarters, focusing on melee skills…"
msgstr "근거리에서 전투가 발생해, 근접전 기술에 의존합니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1817 src/mission_companion.cpp:1868
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1973
#, c-format
msgid "Through brute force the party smashed through the group of %d undead!"
msgstr "일행들은 압도적인 힘으로 %d 시체 무리를 쓰러뜨리고 나아갑니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1821 src/mission_companion.cpp:1872
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1977
msgid "Unfortunately they were overpowered by the undead…  I'm sorry."
msgstr "불행히도 일행들은 시체 무리에 압도당했습니다… 유감입니다."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1830
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s returns from patrol having earned %d merch and a fair bit of experience…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 순찰을 통해 $%d(을)를 벌었고, 그럭저럭 경험을 쌓았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1833 src/mission_companion.cpp:1920
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s was impressed with %s's performance and gave you a small bonus (25 merch)"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1839
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s feels more confident in your abilities and is willing to let you "
"participate in daring raids."
msgstr "%s(은)는 당신의 능력을 잘 알게 되었으며, 당신을 기꺼이 위험한 약탈에 참여시켜줄 것입니다."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1917
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s returns from the raid having earned %d merch and a fair bit of "
"experience…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 약탈을 통해 $%d(을)를 벌었고, 그럭저럭 경험을 쌓았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:1931 src/mission_companion.cpp:2029
#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2227
#, c-format
msgid "%s returned with a %s for you!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 %s(을)를 가지고 돌아왔습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2019
#, c-format
msgid "%s returns from the raid having a fair bit of experience…"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2049
#, c-format
msgid "%s returned with some medical equipment that should help the doctor!"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2069
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s returns from working as a laborer having earned %d merch and a bit of "
"experience…"
msgstr ""

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2074 src/mission_companion.cpp:2232
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s feels more confident in your companions and is willing to let them "
"participate in advanced tasks."
msgstr "%s(은)는 당신의 동료들에 대해 잘 알게 되었으며, 기꺼이 더 복잡한 업무에 참여시켜줄 것입니다."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2103
#, c-format
msgid "While %s was framing a building, one of the walls began to collapse…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 건물을 짜맞추던 도중, 벽이 무너지기 시작했습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2106
#, c-format
msgid "In the blink of an eye, %s threw a brace up and averted a disaster."
msgstr "눈 깜짝할 사이에, %s(이)가 버팀대를 들어올려 재난을 피했습니다."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2109
#, c-format
msgid "Darting out a window, %s escaped the collapse."
msgstr "창문으로 튀어나온 덕분에, %s(이)가 붕괴에서 탈출했습니다."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2111 src/mission_companion.cpp:2115
#, c-format
msgid "%s didn't make it out in time…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 제때 탈출하지 못했습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2112
#, c-format
msgid "but %s was rescued from the debris with only minor injuries!"
msgstr "그러나 %s(은)는 자잘한 부상만 입은 채 잔해에서 구출되었습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2116
msgid "Everyone who was trapped under the collapsing roof died…"
msgstr "무너진 지붕에 깔린 이들은 모두 사망했습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2117
msgid "I'm sorry, there is nothing we could do."
msgstr "유감이지만, 우리가 더 할수 있는게 없네."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2129
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s returns from working as a carpenter having earned %d merch and a bit of "
"experience…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 목수로 일하며 $%d(을)를 벌었고, 그럭저럭 경험을 쌓았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2148
#, c-format
msgid "While foraging, a beast began to stalk %s…"
msgstr "채집 도중에 어느 짐승이 %s(을)를 쫓아오기 시작했습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2157
#, c-format
msgid "Alerted by a rustle, %s fled to the safety of the outpost!"
msgstr "바스락거리는 소리를 눈치채고, %s(이)가 안전한 전진기지까지 도망쳤습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2159
#, c-format
msgid "As soon as the cougar sprang, %s darted to the safety of the outpost!"
msgstr "쿠거가 튀어나오자마자, %s(이)가 안전한 전진기지까지 도망쳤습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2162
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s was caught unaware and was forced to fight the creature at close range!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 무방비한 채로 덮쳐져, 적대 개체와 근접전 상황에서 싸워야 했습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2168
#, c-format
msgid "%s was able to scare off the bear after delivering a nasty blow!"
msgstr "%s(은)는 인상적인 일격을 먹여 곰을 쫓아내는데 성공했습니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2171
#, c-format
msgid "%s beat the cougar into a bloody pulp!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 쿠거를 피떡으로 만듭니다!"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2175
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s was able to hold off the first wolf, but the others that were skulking in"
" the tree line caught up…"
msgstr "%s(은)는 첫번째 늑대는 막을 수 있었지만, 나무 사이에 숨어있던 다른 늑대들에게 붙잡히고 말았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2177
msgid "I'm sorry, there wasn't anything we could do…"
msgstr "유감이지만, 우리가 할 수 있던게 없었습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2179
#, c-format
msgid ""
"We… we don't know what exactly happened, but we found %s's gear ripped and "
"bloody…"
msgstr "우리… 우리도 무슨 일이 일어났는지 정확히는 모르지만, %s의 소지품이 망가지고 피투성이가 된 채인걸 찾았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2181
msgid "I fear your companion won't be returning."
msgstr "유감이지만 당신의 동료는 돌아오지 않을 거야."

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2196
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s returns from working as a forager having earned %d merch and a bit of "
"experience…"
msgstr "%s(이)가 농부로 일하며 $%d(을)를 벌었고, 그럭저럭 경험을 쌓았습니다…"

#: src/mission_companion.cpp:2322
#, c-format
msgid "Engagement between %d members of %s %s and %d %s%s!"
msgstr "%d명의 %s %s(와)과 %d %s%s(이)가 교전합니다!"

