"a soft robotic voice say, \"Unhand this patient immediately!  If you keep "
"interfering with the procedure I'll be forced to call law enforcement.\""
msgstr "부드러운 로봇 음성이 \"즉시 이 환자에게서 손을 떼십시오! 계속 절차를 방해한다면 법 집행관을 부를 것입니다.\" 라고 말합니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2614
msgid ""
"a soft robotic voice say, \"Greetings, nurse.  Please take good care of this"
" patient.\""
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2652
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s dumps the contents of its bag on the ground and drops the bag on top "
"of it."
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2697 src/monattack.cpp:2715
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flashes a LED and departs.  Human officer on scene."
msgstr "%s(은)는 LED를 비추고 날아가 버립니다. 인간 경찰관이 현장에 온다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2705 src/monattack.cpp:2723
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s acknowledges you as an officer responding, but hangs around to watch."
msgstr "%s(은)는 신분증을 확인하고 주변경계 업무로 돌아갑니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2707 src/monattack.cpp:2740
msgid "Probably some now-obsolete Internal Affairs subroutine…"
msgstr "현재는 구식화된 내사 서브루틴 때문일 것ㅇ비니다..."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2725
msgid "Ops used to do that in case you needed backup…"
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2731
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flashes a LED and departs.  SWAT's working the area."
msgstr "%s(은)는 LED를 비추고 날아가 버립니다. 이 지역에서 SWAT가 활동하고 있었던 것 같습니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2738
#, c-format
msgid "The %s acknowledges you as SWAT onsite, but hangs around to watch."
msgstr "%s는 SWAT의 신분증을 확인해, 주변 경계의 업무로 돌아왔습니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2747
#, c-format
msgid "The %s flashes a LED and departs.  The Feds got this."
msgstr "%s(은)는 LED를 비추고 떠나버립니다. 연방 수사관이 이를 확인했을 것입니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2760
#, c-format
msgid "The %s takes your picture!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 당신의 사진을 찍었습니다!"

#: src/monattack.cpp:2765
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Citizen <male_full_name>!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2767
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Citizen <female_full_name>!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2770
#, c-format
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Citizen %s!\""
msgstr "로봇 목소리가 터져나옵니다.  \"시민 %s!\""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2772
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Citizen… database connection lost!\""
msgstr ""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2777
#, c-format
msgid "\"Drop your %s!  Now!\""
msgstr "\"%s(을)를 버리시오!  당장!\""

#: src/monattack.cpp:2832
#, c-format
msgid "The %s attempts to shock you but you dodge."
msgstr "%s(이)가 당신을 감전시키려고 했지만 피했습니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2838 src/monattack.cpp:2846
#, c-format
msgid "The %s unsuccessfully attempts to shock you."
msgstr "%s(이)가 당신을 감전시키려다 실패했습니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2847
#, c-format
msgid "The %s unsuccessfully attempts to shock <npcname>."
msgstr "%s(이)가 <npcname>(을)를 감전시키는데 실패했습니다."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2856
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shocks you!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 전기충격을 가합니다!"

#: src/monattack.cpp:2857
#, c-format
msgid "The %s shocks <npcname>!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 <npcname>에게 전기충격을 가합니다!"

#: src/monattack.cpp:2880
msgid "beep-beep."
msgstr "삑-삑."

#: src/monattack.cpp:2894
msgid "boop!"
msgstr "붑!"

#: src/monattack.cpp:2899
#, c-format
msgid "The %s opens up with its rifle!"
msgstr "%s(이)가 소총을 조준합니다!"

#: src/monattack.cpp:3143
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Citizen, Halt!\""
msgstr "로봇 목소리가 터져나옵니다. \"멈추시오, 시민!\""

#: src/monattack.cpp:3146
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Please put down your weapon.\""
msgstr "로봇 목소리가 터져나옵니다. \"손에 든 무기를 버리시오.\""

#: src/monattack.cpp:3150
msgid "a robotic voice boom, \"Come out with your hands up!\""
msgstr "로봇 목소리가 터져나옵니다. \"손을 들고 이곳으로 나오시오!\""

#: src/monattack.cpp:3154
msgid "a police siren, whoop WHOOP"
msgstr "경찰 사이렌 소리. 위이잉 위이잉"

#. ~ %1$s is the name of the zombie upgrading the other, %2$s is the zombie
