#: src/newcharacter.cpp:1390
msgid ""
"A measure of wits, proprioception, and acuity.  Perceptive characters excel at ranged accuracy, critical hits, and striking weakpoints.  Perception is broadly useful in combat, but most benefits stabbing weapons.\n"
