#~ "Excuse me for a moment.\" The intercom turns off abruptly.  It comes back on after roughly a minute, and when it speaks again, another voice is on the other side, speaking carefully.\n"
#~ "\n"
#~ "\"Yes… the Exodii.  We have yet to make contact, but we are keenly interested in their capabilities and technology.  If you were to provide us with, say, five rounds, in addition to the rifle itself and a magazine suitable for it, we believe we would be able to replicate the parts.  We expect it to take three days of research.\"\n"
